Z||000000||Cliff Pennock||09-05-2001||06:02 AM||||KaZaa has been touted as the next Napster. It is currently used by over 7 million people. But what few people seem to know, is that KaZaa installs a program that alters the content of webpages that you visit. It installs "TopText", a program that turns keywords on any website into links to advertisers. It even changes existing links on pages.<P>Read all about it <A HREF="http://www.scumware.com" TARGET=_blank>here</A>.<P>People will do anything to make a buck.||||reg||8
